<title>USA: AlliedSignal to provide space vehicle part.</title>
<headline>AlliedSignal to provide space vehicle part.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-09-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>AlliedSignal Inc's aerospace unit said on Tuesday that it was awarded an $8.2 million contract from Orbital Sciences Corp to make a hydraulic and electrical system for NASA's Reusable Launch Vehicle program.</p>
<p>Oribtal Sciences received the contract to build the vehicle in June, AlliedSignal said.</p>
<p>The vehicle is expected to make 25 flights annually by the year 2000, AlliedSignal said.</p>
</text>
